{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_076330","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"输入设定日期。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":21,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"1964年8月24日。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":19,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"<R=　地点　,LOCATION>？","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=　地点　,LOCATION>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":28,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED; SOURCE_RUBY_SPACING_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"苏联境内，Tselinoyarsk。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":30,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"任务？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":9,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"支援一名潜入特工。目标是救回一名核武器技术人员。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"那名特工是谁？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":21,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"你的弟子，也是与你最亲近的……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"……了解。说明目前的任务进展。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"在你的协助下，特工已经成功与<R=技术人员,TARGET>接触。现在只需等待<R=回收,RECOVERY>。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=技术人员,TARGET>\", \"<R=回收,RECOVERY>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":114,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"推断接下来你应该采取的行动。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"……从那名特工手中夺走技术人员。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"为了什么？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":15,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"作为叛逃时的见面礼。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":30,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"……为什么要叛逃？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"为了和昔日的战友重建特种部队。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"不对！我问的不是目的，而是理由。我要知道你为什么背叛祖国。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":17,"cn_text":"……我并不是为了背叛<R=祖国,AMERICA>才决定叛逃，而是企图叛逃的结果，让我背叛了祖国。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=祖国,AMERICA>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":120,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":18,"cn_text":"果然到了这里，回答就会变慢……是对推理选择缺乏把握吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":19,"cn_text":"身为西方英雄的你，苏联会相信吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":20,"cn_text":"除了核技术人员，我还会提供<R=便携式核炮弹,DAVY CROCKETT>，以博取<R=苏军总参谋部情报总局,GRU>军官们的欢心。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=便携式核炮弹,DAVY CROCKETT>\", \"<R=苏军总参谋部情报总局,GRU>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":146,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":21,"cn_text":"……然后，你发射了核武器。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":22,"cn_text":"发射……核武器？我？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":30,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":23,"cn_text":"没错。射向苏联境内。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":30,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":24,"cn_text":"核武器……让人血液冻结，夺走明天。我……发射核武器？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":25,"cn_text":"人类造下的<R=业,KARMA>……不，这是我的<R=业,KARMA>吗？由我的<R=过错,MISTAKE>造下的<R=业,KARMA>……我……我……！","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=业,KARMA>\", \"<R=业,KARMA>\", \"<R=过错,MISTAKE>\", \"<R=业,KARMA>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":147,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":26,"cn_text":"……<R=命令,ATTENTION>。停止正向推理，与<R=知识,KNOWLEDGE>库进行核对。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=命令,ATTENTION>\", \"<R=知识,KNOWLEDGE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":91,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":27,"cn_text":"<R=了解,READY>。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=了解,READY>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":19,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":28,"cn_text":"……核对完成。修正推理。夺取技术人员开发的新型武器后，我会将<R=　核　炮　弹　,DAVY CROCKETT>射向武器开发局。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=　核　炮　弹　,DAVY CROCKETT>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":153,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED; SOURCE_RUBY_SPACING_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":29,"cn_text":"正向推理和反向推理发生<R=　冲突　,CONFLICT>……。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=　冲突　,CONFLICT>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":67,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED; SOURCE_RUBY_SPACING_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":30,"cn_text":"<R=命令,ATTENTION>。返回正向推理。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=命令,ATTENTION>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":44,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":31,"cn_text":"<R=了解,READY>。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=了解,READY>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":19,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":32,"cn_text":"……你的弟子前来夺回核技术人员。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":33,"cn_text":"把他赶走。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":15,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":34,"cn_text":"他不会放弃。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":35,"cn_text":"让我的战友打倒他。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":36,"cn_text":"所有人都被他反杀。不仅如此，连接受你叛逃的GRU军官也被那名弟子和新型核武器一起消灭。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":123,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":37,"cn_text":"你应该采取什么行动？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":30,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":38,"cn_text":"……由我和他战斗。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":39,"cn_text":"为什么？既然那名军官已经死了，你就没有理由再和那个特工作战。逃走就行。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":105,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":40,"cn_text":"我……必须和他战斗。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":30,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":41,"cn_text":"我不明白理由。说到底，有你这种人在身边，GRU军官为什么还会被打倒？你抛弃了他？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":114,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":42,"cn_text":"我……一直在等……一直。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":43,"cn_text":"改投KGB就行了。把剩下的<R=　核　炮　弹　,DAVY CROCKETT>当作见面礼。像你这样的英雄……他们不可能拒绝。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=　核　炮　弹　,DAVY CROCKETT>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":141,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED; SOURCE_RUBY_SPACING_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":44,"cn_text":"随波而去吧。我只能留在这里。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":45,"cn_text":"我问的不是这个！把推理依据说出来！！告诉我真相……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":46,"cn_text":"战斗的对象由政治决定。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":47,"cn_text":"为什么不回答我！？这样……这样简直就像你一直在等那个男人来杀你！","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":96,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":48,"cn_text":"我是卖国贼……背叛了祖国。被杀也是理所当然……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":49,"cn_text":"连你也这么说！？不是的吧？你不是那种人！","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":50,"cn_text":"杀了我……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":51,"cn_text":"住手！住手！！<R=　命令　,ATTENTION>！停止推理！！","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=　命令　,ATTENTION>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":68,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED; SOURCE_RUBY_SPACING_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":52,"cn_text":"一个人死，一个人活……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":53,"cn_text":"为什么还不停！？停止推理！","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":54,"cn_text":"很美吧？生命的终结……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":55,"cn_text":"强制停止！！","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":56,"cn_text":"……每次到这里，推理都会失控。果然，解开真相的钥匙掌握在那个男人手里吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":108,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":57,"cn_text":"必须从那个男人口中问出来。无论如何……！","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""}]}